  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes take 10...34...40 cold damage. For 30 [sic] seconds, your attack skills remove enchantments from knocked-down foes. When this enchantment ends, nearby foes are affected by Cracked Armor for 1...8...10 second[s].",
      "zhTW": "施展此加持時，對附近敵人造成 10～40 冰凍傷害。持續 30 秒，你使用攻擊技能擊中倒地的敵人時，將使該敵人失去一項加持。此加持結束時，使附近敵人遭受碎甲 1～10 秒。"
    },
